{"id":"f9a798480c90ed02","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Maximal Filter","display":"df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter — ZFC Order11 Maximal Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter — ZFC Order11 Maximal Filter","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-maximal-filter — ZFC Order11 Maximal Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9df1aa443914fe25\" href=\"?note=9df1aa443914fe25\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset\">58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,L,\\leq_L\\in V\">\\(F,L,\\leq_L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9df1aa443914fe25\" href=\"?note=9df1aa443914fe25\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset\">58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MaximalFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MaximalFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MaximalFilter}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\land F\\neq L\\land\\forall G\\subseteq L\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(G,L,\\leq_L)\\land G\\neq L\\land F\\subseteq G)\\to G=F\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MaximalFilter}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\land F\\neq L\\land\\forall G\\subseteq L\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(G,L,\\leq_L)\\land G\\neq L\\land F\\subseteq G)\\to G=F\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximality is among proper filters on the same explicitly ordered carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset","status":"resolved","id":"9df1aa443914fe25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset","status":"resolved","id":"9df1aa443914fe25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,L,\\leq_L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11MaximalFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}